title: プロイセン連立交渉
view-if: prussia_coalition_trigger = 1
on-arrival: was_in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia = 0; was_in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 0; was_in_weimar_coalition_prussia = 0; was_in_grand_coalition_prussia = 0; was_in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia = 1 if in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia == 1 or in_minority_social_catholic_coalition_prussia == 1; was_in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 1 if in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia == 1 or in_minority_social_liberal_coalition_prussia == 1; was_in_weimar_coalition_prussia = 1 if ((in_weimar_coalition_prussia == 1 or in_minority_weimar_coalition_prussia == 1) or (in_grand_coalition_prussia == 1 and lvp_formed)); was_in_grand_coalition_prussia = 1 if (in_grand_coalition_prussia == 1 or in_minority_grand_coalition_prussia == 1); in_right_coalition_prussia = 0; in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia = 0; in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 0; in_weimar_coalition_prussia = 0; in_grand_coalition_prussia = 0; in_minority_grand_coalition_prussia = 0; in_popular_front_prussia = 0; in_left_front_prussia = 0; sapd_toleration_prussia = 0; in_spd_majority_prussia = 0; in_center_right_coalition_prussia = 0; in_far_right_coalition_prussia = 0; in_minority_weimar_coalition_prussia = 0; in_minority_social_catholic_coalition_prussia = 0; in_minority_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 0; spd_prussia = 0; right_prussia = 0; ddp_in_popular_front_prussia = 0; kpd_goals_seen_prussia = 0; spd_toleration_prussia = 0; prussia_coalition_trigger = 0
on-departure: {!
if (Q.in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia || Q.in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia || Q.in_weimar_coalition_prussia == 1 || Q.in_grand_coalition_prussia == 1 || Q.in_popular_front_prussia == 1 || Q.in_left_front_prussia == 1 || Q.sapd_toleration_prussia == 1 || Q.in_spd_majority_prussia == 1 || Q.in_minority_weimar_coalition_prussia == 1 || Q.in_minority_grand_coalition_prussia == 1) {
    Q.spd_prussia = 1;
    Q.right_prussia = 0;
} else if (Q.in_right_coalition_prussia == 1 || Q.in_center_right_coalition_prussia == 1 || Q.prussia_leader == "Papen" || Q.prussia_leader == "Goring" || Q.in_far_right_coalition_prussia == 1) {
    Q.right_prussia = 1;
    Q.spd_prussia = 0;
}
!}
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: 1
face-image: img/prussia_flag_old.png
go-to: coalition_menu

= 連立政権の形成

連立政権が崩壊し、新たな政権の枠組みを形成する必要がある。

@coalition_menu

- @spd_majority
- @spd_minority
- @weimar_coalition_prussia
- @social_christian_coalition_prussia
- @social_liberal_coalition_prussia
- @minority_social_christian_coalition_prussia
- @minority_social_liberal_coalition_prussia
- @minority_weimar_coalition
- @grand_coalition_prussia
- @minority_grand_coalition_prussia
- @far_right_coalition_prussia
- @left_coalition_prussia
- @popular_front_coalition_prussia
- @right_coalition_prussia
- @center_right_coalition_prussia
- @bourgeois_coalition_prussia
- @bourgeois_coalition_kvp_prussia
- @call_new_elections: 新たな選挙を実施する。


@spd_majority
title: <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>単独過半数
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>: [+ spd_r_prussia +]%
view-if: spd_r_prussia >= 50
on-arrival: pro_republic += 5; reichswehr_loyalty -= 0.05 if chancellor == "Braun"; ddp_right += 2; dvp_right += 4; lvp_right += 3; liberal_cooperation += 5; bourgeois_cooperation += 5; prussia_leader = "Braun"; in_spd_majority_prussia = 1; prussian_police_loyalty += 0.1; prussian_police_strength += 50; democratization += 3; coup_progress += 1; capital_strike_progress += 2; ddp_relation -= 3; lvp_relation -= 3; z_relation -= 3; spd_prussia = 1

ついに<span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>の単独政権が実現した！ 長きにわたる選挙運動が実を結んだのだ。もはや連立政権に煩わされることはなく、あらゆる政策が実行可能となる。ただし、かつての連立相手は右傾化し始めるだろう。

ブラウンがプロイセン州首相に選出された。

@spd_minority
title: <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>少数政権
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #9B0000;">SAPD</span>の閣外協力：([+ socialist_front_prussia +]%)
view-if: socialist_front_prussia >= 50 and kpd_relation >= 50 and sapd_formed and spd_r_prussia < 50
on-arrival: pro_republic += 5; reichswehr_loyalty -= 0.05 if chancellor == "Braun"; ddp_right += 2; dvp_right += 4; lvp_right += 3; liberal_cooperation += 5; bourgeois_cooperation += 5; prussia_leader = "Braun"; sapd_toleration_prussia = 1; prussian_police_loyalty += 0.1; prussian_police_strength += 50; democratization += 3; coup_progress += 1; capital_strike_progress += 2; ddp_relation -= 3; lvp_relation -= 3; z_relation -= 3; spd_prussia = 1

<span style="color: #9B0000;">SAPD</span>の閣外協力により、<span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>少数政権の形成に成功した。もはや以前の連立相手の要求に縛られることはないが、彼らは右傾化し始めるだろう。

ブラウンがプロイセン州首相に選出された。


@social_christian_coalition_prussia
title: <span style="color: #c00000;">社会</span>・<span style="color: #000000;">キリスト教</span>連立を形成できるか？
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ z_party_name +]**</span> ([+ social_catholic_coalition_prussia +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">[+ z_party_name +]</span> ([+ social_catholic_coalition_prussia +]%) [? if far_right_coalition_prussia >= 50: - <span style="color: #7A3C00;">極右</span>・<span style="color: #3E88B3;">右翼</span>勢力が政権を形成できる。 ?] [? if not ((z_relation >= 70 and cvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (z_relation >= 60 and cvp_ideology == "Left")): - <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>との関係が十分ではない。 ?]
view-if: social_catholic_coalition_prussia >= 50 and cvp_formed
choose-if: far_right_coalition_prussia < 50 and ((z_relation >= 70 and cvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (z_relation >= 60 and cvp_ideology == "Left"))
on-arrival: in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia = 1; was_in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia = 1; prussia_leader = "Stegerwald" if cvp_leader != "Stegerwald"; prussia_leader = "Brüning" if z_leader == "Stegerwald"; pro_republic += 6; new_middle_z += 4; new_middle_spd += 2; z_relation += 5; reformist_dissent -= 10; spd_prussia = 1

<span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>と<span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>による「<span style="color: #c00000;">社会</span>・<span style="color: #000000;">キリスト教</span>連立」政権を形成するのに十分な票を確保した。意外にも、良好な関係と比較的好意的な<span style="color: #000000;">**[+ z_party_name +]**</span>指導部のおかげで、歴史的に<span style="color: #000000;">中央党</span>左派の影響力が強いプロイセンにおいて、同党を連立へ迎えることに成功した。

[? if prussia_leader != "Braun": [+ prussia_leader +]がプロイセン州首相に選出された。?]

@social_liberal_coalition_prussia
title: <span style="color: #c00000;">社会</span>・[? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">自由主義</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">自由主義</span>?]連立を形成できる。
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?] ([+ social_liberal_coalition_prussia +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #FFCC00;">LVP</span>?] ([+ social_liberal_coalition_prussia +]%) [? if far_right_coalition_prussia >= 50: - <span style="color: #7A3C00;">極右</span>・<span style="color: #3E88B3;">右翼</span>勢力が政権を形成できる。 ?] [? if not ((ddp_relation >= 60 and ddp_ideology == "Right") or (ddp_relation >= 50 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") or (ddp_relation >= 40 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and not lvp_formed: - <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>との関係が十分ではない。 ?] [? if not ((lvp_relation >= 70 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation >= 60 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation >= 50 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed: - <span style="color: #FFCC00;">LVP</span>との関係が十分ではない。 ?]
view-if: social_liberal_coalition_prussia >= 50 and cvp_formed
choose-if: far_right_coalition_prussia < 50 and ((((ddp_relation >= 60 and ddp_ideology == "Right") or (ddp_relation >= 50 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") or (ddp_relation >= 40 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and not lvp_formed) or (((lvp_relation >= 70 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation >= 60 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation >= 50 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed))
on-arrival: in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 1; was_in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 1; liberal_cooperation -= 1 if liberal_parliament == 1; prussia_leader = "Braun"; pro_republic += 3; ddp_relation += 5; lvp_relation += 5; reformist_dissent -= 10; new_middle_ddp += 2; new_middle_lvp += 2; new_middle_spd += 2; spd_prussia = 1

<span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>と[? if ddp_name == "DDP" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**民主党**</span>?][? if ddp_name == "DStP" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**国家党**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**自由人民党**</span>?] [? if not lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>)?][? if lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>)?]による「<span style="color: #c00000;">社会</span>・[? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">自由主義</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">自由主義</span>?]連立」政権を形成するのに十分な票を得た！ 右翼的な<span style="color: #000000;">**[+ z_party_name +]**</span>の成立が、この組み合わせを可能にしたのだ。[? if liberal_parliament == 1: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>が独自行動を取ったため、自由主義議員団には亀裂が生じた。 ?]

[? if prussia_leader != "Braun": [+ prussia_leader +]がプロイセン州首相に選出された。 ?]

